    "UIName": "SecuriMax",
    "Id": "chassisdef_securimax_SC-200",
    "Name": "SecuriMax",
    "Details": "The SecuriMax SC-200 mounts two heavy rifles and six machine guns spread across its arms and torsos, backed by two flamers for overkill firepower. An LRM 5 in the left torso and SRM 6 in the right round out the loadout, though both missile systems suffer from their accuracy being hampered due to the limited fire control systems of an Industrial Mech.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.91</color></b>",
    "Icon": "chrPrfMech_awesomeBase-001_portrait"
  },
  "VariantName": "SC-200",
